# Scalability Considerations

### Partitioning

Partition event streams by source IP (or a stable hash) so all events for the same IP are processed consistently.

### Stateless Services

API gateways and collectors remain stateless and scale horizontally behind load balancers.

### Stateful Stream Processing

Use keyed state in the stream processor with checkpointing for fault tolerance.

### Caching

Keep the most frequently queried reputations in Redis to achieve sub-10 ms lookups.

---

# Reliability

* Multi-region deployment with active-active replication.
* Exactly-once processing where supported.
* Idempotent event ingestion to handle retries.
* Circuit breakers around external threat intelligence providers.
* Backpressure handling in streaming pipelines.
* Dead-letter queues for malformed events.

---

# Security

* Mutual TLS between services.
* Encryption at rest and in transit.
* Role-based access control for APIs.
* Audit logging for rule and model changes.
* Tenant isolation for multi-tenant deployments.

---

# Observability

Track key metrics:

* Ingestion rate
* End-to-end processing latency
* Detection latency
* API latency (P50/P95/P99)
* False-positive and false-negative rates
* Model drift
* Queue lag
* Cache hit ratio
* Rule evaluation latency

Use distributed tracing to diagnose latency across ingestion, enrichment, scoring, and alerting.

---

# Design Trade-offs

| Decision                   | Benefit                     | Trade-off                                        |
| -------------------------- | --------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |
| Streaming analytics        | Near real-time detection    | Higher operational complexity                    |
| Dynamic reputation scoring | Adapts to changing behavior | Requires continuous feature updates              |
| Feature store              | Fast online inference       | Additional infrastructure to maintain            |
| ML + rules                 | Better detection coverage   | Model lifecycle and explainability challenges    |
| Multi-region active-active | High availability           | Increased replication and consistency complexity |

